On Thursday, September 20, 2012 2:45:09 AM UTC-7, Michael Smith wrote:
> (I guess in rmr the sorting happens behind the scenes before calling the reducer.)

Sorting is performed by Hadoop, rmr just reads whatever hadoop sends in whatever order it is sent. We could control it with hadoop streaming options but until recently they were geared toward text formats only. A recent patch should pave the way for rmr to add some secondary (sorting) key features as well. If anyone has use cases for this please don't keep them to yourself.

Antonio

